Subject: [PATCH 022/225] soh: rename func_800F4254 -> Audio_PlaySwordChargeSfx

Name source: zeldaret/oot.
Defined in soh/src/code/audio_general.c.

Provenance comments accompany the definition and every header declaration,
so the name can be re-derived or overturned later. See
tasks/reference/ocarina/decomp-renaming.md.
---
 soh/include/functions.h                                   | 2 +-
 soh/src/code/audio_general.c                              | 3 ++-
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_M_Thunder/z_en_m_thunder.c | 6 +++---
 3 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/include/functions.h b/soh/include/functions.h
index d19b6654c..a77d31fec 100644
--- a/soh/include/functions.h
+++ b/soh/include/functions.h
@@ -2079,7 +2079,7 @@ void func_800F436C(Vec3f* pos, u16 sfxId, f32 arg2);
 void func_800F4414(Vec3f* pos, u16 sfxId, f32);
 void func_800F44EC(s8 arg0, s8 arg1);
 void func_800F4524(Vec3f* pos, u16 sfxId, s8 arg2);
-void func_800F4254(Vec3f* pos, u8 arg1);
+void Audio_PlaySwordChargeSfx(Vec3f* pos, u8 arg1);  // was func_800F4254 [oot]
 void func_800F436C(Vec3f*, u16 sfxId, f32 arg2);
 void func_800F4414(Vec3f*, u16 sfxId, f32 arg2);
 void Audio_PlaySoundRiver(Vec3f* pos, f32 freqScale);
